```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "follow a nym by adding it to a circle, local and private"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.circle.follows", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.circle.follows"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.circle.follows"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.circle.follows ~ the follow: recognise the nym, label it, add it to a circle

`lares circle add <nym> to=<circle>` follows a nym in one gesture over three local stores: the handle-book recognises it (already known, or TOFU-admitted from a carried self-certifying card, `--card <file>`), `--petname <label>` sets its private local label, and the circle takes it. The membership rides the private circles doc, which syncs to the operator's own devices and never federates to a stranger. An unmet nym with no card refuses: carry its card first.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ follow · admit

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`follow` params=`nym/<nym> ~ follow a known nym`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`admit` params=`nym/<nym> card/card.json petname/Mara ~ admit an unmet nym from its card and follow it`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ nym · to · petname · card · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nym` params=`takes/nym needs/required seat/1 as/<nym> ~ the nym's verifying key, hex`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`to` params=`takes/circle default/following ~ the circle; following, the primary system circle, stands by default`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`petname` params=`takes/label ~ the nym's private local label`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`card` params=`takes/host-path ~ a carried HandleCard JSON file that TOFU-admits an unmet nym`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose handle-book and circles act; absent, the one face standing open`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ edits this face's private graph alone; nothing crosses the wire`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.circle.follows nym/<nym>]] ~ add needs a nym; an unmet nym with no card refuses (FollowRefused); a card file that reads no JSON refuses`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the follow store refused; the line names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ followed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`followed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[nym circle recognized petname federated]] ~ the nym stands in the circle; federated reads false`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares circle add

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares circle add]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

